#: scenario2:scenario2_D22FE458_8A7D_4673_90FE_7646580B8285
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8f8d017b2a5941e93b1c4d2f1f89c591dc48cf8e3bee2ab28d0b7713b73529e
#. default-sha256: fd05f2fb4a130d406a9a47a288b1f3f90fcb71aaf087576e14a5472085d59e40
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D22FE458_8A7D_4673_90FE_7646580B8285"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His psyche drifted erratically between human and beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫——他的精神，⟪k:4⟫在人与兽之间徘徊。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_613DC2C4_840E_4A8F_9D57_5CAB67B354D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b31837ff1bb52ec7bb4d68f996c5b0d7357afce021874909dbdc0fd8c1482a4
#. default-sha256: f3c61ccec1277943b9d6e91fd38424fe20caba0f614a0af064c121cbfcf92f4d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_613DC2C4_840E_4A8F_9D57_5CAB67B354D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he accepted himself as human, it might cause memories better left buried to return to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果承认自己是人的话，⟪k:1⟫也许就会解开被封印的记忆。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4E8DBE94_0F0F_455E_BD75_60909F199278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 012a477e89b9118da7f23fb4e725f65d6a58202ee49e8309dea555db5fcd1dd3
#. default-sha256: e41e3ed93ec7c6d88ae081a157789a7016e010f1e0e8ef08ee273d53a822f691
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4E8DBE94_0F0F_455E_BD75_60909F199278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he accepted himself as a beast, in exchange for his memories,⟪k:1⟫he would no longer be "
"able to rejoin human society."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果承认自己是兽的话，⟪k:1⟫虽然可以舍弃不堪回首的记忆，⟪k:2⟫但代价是再也回不到人世了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_27E0A2EF_2853_4A32_A306_7FD78DEF8BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9274e2bd5ef02f897cd882ab6bd383d6056dd4bf3404124532dfdc5fb1c701f4
#. default-sha256: 812c54673c0fda41c1bf40801a9c0f6f6b862e43597c7e4806c1fb9cefe49e1b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_27E0A2EF_2853_4A32_A306_7FD78DEF8BD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl fervently supported him in these precarious times."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫白发少女支持着在人与兽之间摇摆不定的他。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_85DB32B0_F282_4C4F_AADE_25DF44D1793A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3baed59fb2c20bf8cfb1cadecd0e4ed9a2dd4159faaead4311a277238bf274d
#. default-sha256: dc2addb082ca2548ff7189952bf9fbcaad08d0c0e975ea3ef1edb8bfd1ef5356
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_85DB32B0_F282_4C4F_AADE_25DF44D1793A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was quite amazed. ⟪k:1⟫I had never imagined she would grow to be such a strong woman."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆也很惊讶，⟪k:1⟫一个弱女子竟能做到如此地步。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_81BAC672_0240_4367_B8F1_AEEE5EF63437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1682e7c6ab79252ee202180513b63936f26c49d11cf9f93600a310f77352b8ea
#. default-sha256: 0e5c6ca456f813e8773d2f38955f850df2eb8f574ab78bf5b2e78869d5bfa4ea
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_81BAC672_0240_4367_B8F1_AEEE5EF63437"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, God is a cruel master. ⟪k:1⟫For what strength He gave her spiritually, He took "
"in equal part from her physically."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫上帝也喜欢捉弄人呢。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫精神强大的少女，⟪k:4⟫肉体却十分软弱。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_05F0A744_A738_48CE_AC4F_1752BD288946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: befa74ed9d6f6cf771230e950f55e7478968f40dff5011f27149ac66f42a4d46
#. default-sha256: 1277271aad1c166eadc3fe41de428928ad1b83b5dd2409bceabed0b7598e4c79
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_05F0A744_A738_48CE_AC4F_1752BD288946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she persisted, day in and day out, to stay by the man’s side, one day, she suddenly "
"fell ill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫能坚持陪在巴斯蒂亚身边的少女，⟪k:1⟫有一天突然病倒了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_634710E0_4271_494D_8734_B73C81AB4A91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58ea02a6062bd46cfe3133783f3448bc5f23cb2fe6b6885bd0a70bc7091610f7
#. default-sha256: f36d392e654e2726cdf93e4c6e8a97c1a28ba305a72c862b07388389d92ae75e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_634710E0_4271_494D_8734_B73C81AB4A91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With her in the throes of a high fever and not knowing the cause, he fell into a perpetual "
"panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她发了高烧，原因不明。⟪k:1⟫男人仓皇失措，⟪k:2⟫乱了阵脚。 "

#: scenario2:scenario2_3AE81AF8_72E6_46B9_87D7_D2F4F26D2594
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9bb525a04913ff275ee21ec61d9422ddfabcd90088356891abbeb63688dbe20
#. default-sha256: 0f9a057ad5ac7f40356e0248b2684d46a69172001fa43a281b9dd4548ba77dca
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3AE81AF8_72E6_46B9_87D7_D2F4F26D2594"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was no medicine in the mansion. ⟪k:1⟫They could hardly manage to put together "
"sufficiently nutritious meals."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫馆里没有药品之类的东西。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫甚至是高营养的食品也没有多少。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_86C68658_873A_40A0_944A_3AFF8C8C15F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61b261ead72f0162cc249e15789e38b118e4202a00245b5494f6e17019bd042c
#. default-sha256: 85f532501640cbd96ca4ac890a7c06af72db123cb311f4230794fe619cdbf03d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86C68658_873A_40A0_944A_3AFF8C8C15F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though there was no medicine, maybe there was something else that could make her feel better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使没有药，⟪k:1⟫至少，⟪k:2⟫应该找找令她打起精神的东西……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_781579D4_483E_40FE_AF37_18A0F7978D13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 204d1c4f3b8f56abb8c7fb5fb55743d792c2a1578b76fc1c71eaf7ce46f82b67
#. default-sha256: de07c9ae8e91a8154bbbe344525cd0cb52bf1fcc0820df1327abe759b24e7065
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_781579D4_483E_40FE_AF37_18A0F7978D13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, everything he could think of required him to leave the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然男人有此想法，⟪k:1⟫但是只有外面才有这些物品。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_FF92B370_1B1F_450C_8CEE_E0A7058049B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cabf05998368e3dcc1323062c7606def7c809e17fa2a04b207d8d1ae0b53f02e
#. default-sha256: 00e0a2599c133e5a2ebe823d1fd4ddf2c68a9eb08d00042859d00bec67aa78fb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FF92B370_1B1F_450C_8CEE_E0A7058049B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Hey... ⟪k:10⟫Hey."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫喂……⟪k:10⟫喂。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3270703E_D7AD_4458_8C31_65257D00792F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe1b6f48c25ecf8dcb4bacbd0e07de953b32cccbef4b51955fa742725836996f
#. default-sha256: 6acd0ff8a216f6b9177e6ad878e4b3118cf11b596b1ee5db2e00e9d234551ad1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3270703E_D7AD_4458_8C31_65257D00792F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario2:scenario2_001F0AE2_2F0B_404C_AA1A_D785C93AA9B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 194e1380cf776f77476cec48cbdded8e9191de0ef017b0886fa2b084b8f41108
#. default-sha256: 6f7f4e037077ce0cd50a7bece327ebf1a16591347672890a0f4b8887098c6e1b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_001F0AE2_2F0B_404C_AA1A_D785C93AA9B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Is there anything you would like?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫你想要……什么东西吗？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A0151887_D25E_4A14_BE0E_3B9B75139582
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 654079bc41c5a8f9c452a2e2dfe7e8842012c5411b0b50ddf8c84e602bc20dfd
#. default-sha256: 04b98452e19b7340feb66112a43406c355926b00ae6743a7238b98eda04c52bc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A0151887_D25E_4A14_BE0E_3B9B75139582"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Anything... ⟪k:2⟫I would like...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫想要的……⟪k:2⟫东西？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_675D2378_B607_43CE_8DAB_78E22BDD345D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 424469e6ddbb9a6fef62ec3ee8569f09c041a66955d79baef5bf3f6360fd426b
#. default-sha256: af4081e778ba280d3e569baac294e8f23d0d2632463eefd9dc670a7fcd94392c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_675D2378_B607_43CE_8DAB_78E22BDD345D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m considering..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我打算…………"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4C48DE42_33E8_45EB_82F7_FCF9CFA52535
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a3837a6cf68d1dc789f576525e3b929a7631bfac5fd143bab4ae78303402bd3
#. default-sha256: 44c8535ec9e742c16ca1df40679f0736928108e5fdde97ed128dc5a397fee89e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4C48DE42_33E8_45EB_82F7_FCF9CFA52535"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫visiting the village."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……去村子里……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5AA70BC1_FCF0_46EF_9164_F66F9D0A6DA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b02a1dcb921bfd3f9a7a3935baa5b0fbb4c56fe8b9d8c99ef61f7854936ed60f
#. default-sha256: 09168f23fa13351c845f7696719cd7e5b4188e259a1e99c71b50f2445575e5d6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5AA70BC1_FCF0_46EF_9164_F66F9D0A6DA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I see...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re going to the village..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫这样啊……⟪k:2⟫您要去村子里了啊………"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0E72AAEA_BFA9_466B_AAC8_843C1EAB28C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd9d5a2aac53072feb45b89dafed68b9c7e06e83301dae425ec830f0c34deadd
#. default-sha256: 9057481eaa3d0068a05262f3b8fb2d62bc40d06e500a93d4fd462a3f7d12189a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0E72AAEA_BFA9_466B_AAC8_843C1EAB28C9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I thought I might be able to get some medicine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫虽然我想请医生……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_31BBE612_F46E_46E3_8340_8AC43F461A39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af8a8b7e6adad4c1858c29074176dbd66034ed720a30742f71a68e91e24aee13
#. default-sha256: bec574691cdd8dee19ee47b14c887bf1a96b4400d47011cc462161e1a0eb9808
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_31BBE612_F46E_46E3_8340_8AC43F461A39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would prefer to bring a doctor here...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but no one would come if they learned you "
"were in this mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫让他开药……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫但是一提到「馆」的话，⟪k:3⟫医生肯定不会来的。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4837F3A8_618A_4A41_8BCA_9F65184841C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f392e857e854e55d784bf4fe9328e3ecf5b7ecb5bad8b12242ef7ed8f44c752
#. default-sha256: eea6d572fccc21d8cf61c3bc05643c81c2fdd9c5f3cfd7d14c72ccafbd740d28
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4837F3A8_618A_4A41_8BCA_9F65184841C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫所以………"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BF0A6369_E0B3_4637_8924_C2EC4BCA7C2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46c2edbff54e3c3553ef89f6de49ccf50013b67defc772826b03eb69337ec1b1
#. default-sha256: 3bffbc9fef9a76709f75dc439a78229ad24605752d66d3c67da13c6fc0443dcb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BF0A6369_E0B3_4637_8924_C2EC4BCA7C2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was planning to put on a disguise—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to enter the village as a person."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫男人打算伪装身份——⟪k:1⟫就是说以普通人的身份，⟪k:2⟫到村子里。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7C2E41D3_243D_485A_BD38_AD1A0ADB69D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bd5d04676263df8bbc4057eb4cf9d7dd5fd84c6a51af6427ec100cdf15106a8
#. default-sha256: ee676aab6c4947bb6e728db510f7fd16ffd8f288fda556c544a543975a1463e2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7C2E41D3_243D_485A_BD38_AD1A0ADB69D8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl smiled when she heard his idea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫听到这个提案后，⟪k:1⟫白发少女高兴地笑了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C3594EDB_5862_465C_8F1E_DE54E325F513
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 137909f1b11f78d9511fead3c5d8c189c13f2d89ce64a2c7ea0da6c952561887
#. default-sha256: f07396daecb76569cca44f1822e342622aefd45ae2ba4327077dfe04f7a340f9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C3594EDB_5862_465C_8F1E_DE54E325F513"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, always wanted him to think of himself as human."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为她一直希望他保持人的理性。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_70401842_E177_492C_93E8_5FA5249EBE4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcd97201e49368cd32917367de4b497639e6b2260cf6771e0112515f2610e389
#. default-sha256: 29eeebaa34fec17a76ef0c6cee9d7666834b7f736abbb39c4798f386b42a46a7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_70401842_E177_492C_93E8_5FA5249EBE4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, because she was so pure-hearted, she did not comprehend..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫她过于善良——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_46DD207F_F77B_462E_AE51_E870377CD651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d43598486ed72cc8c2fcc3576fb89a466bffc8babc230225ab87aab6ab1ff979
#. default-sha256: 64c313f8aada0ed21a9172633ed50b83d330a9ddf8e654550822f4720f3e125e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_46DD207F_F77B_462E_AE51_E870377CD651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the full extent of the slaughter he had confessed to committing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫根本没有理解，⟪k:1⟫男人所说的杀戮，⟪k:2⟫是多么的血腥。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_05DDE8BA_3870_4B45_BA3C_233D3FC7144F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80ae1b830f11a8e4454ee04dab2ec27bddaeee3fb8067fa91a671e6744414f3a
#. default-sha256: ab0460e7f879353a0bf264d660174ac3f4dfe4e9cfdf93ed9d8bf5911b0eff57
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_05DDE8BA_3870_4B45_BA3C_233D3FC7144F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The revenge he had taken on those who had chased him around.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How sinister his "
"cackling and furious his reaping."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫被村民到处追赶的男人实施的复仇，⟪k:1⟫是多么地激烈与凶残。⟪k:2⟫他欢声雀跃的滥杀无辜的情景，"
"⟪k:3⟫是多么地残忍。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_571DB84B_714D_4092_9951_39A38108CD82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b10e3b4b8198c3e41c8226579c33e108b37e898506bbb3c7ea3700fa10b806b
#. default-sha256: f0816a7abcd204cea95d56b6de8d8adb0f79fba6332e8c826ea60ed7887c544d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_571DB84B_714D_4092_9951_39A38108CD82"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She did not grasp just how serious it was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……她不能理解，⟪k:1⟫这宗罪到底有多严重。"

